            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NEH.9.25"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "26",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NEH 9:26"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "26",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Ak ea miigwasineey mureeda nea ghaheawaneey ak gwajaksa deaweedeadaang'u mureeda badahuuka nyaawa, nea ghabwar sibangaagu, ghayi rukwiisa saawa ng'asheega gabiigu saawa headaang'u, ak geesin ng'asheega hees munyas. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NEH.9.26",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NEH.9.26"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "27",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NEH 9:27"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "27",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ak aba seareani ghoah gidiyiisi saawa geatinda weajoodiga nyaawa, geanung' gwasawana saawa; ak aba damandida bea sawanaduutka nyaawaan, hean gooyeawuseey ak giileeysiit saawa nea gindi humng'eeda; nea aba baydeaydaang'u haw giidawi saawa lealeanooda leabu saawa aba geatinda weajoodiga nyaawa. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NEH.9.27",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NEH.9.27"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "28",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NEH 9:28"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "28",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Iidu nea niihiit fuufta, gwasin ng'asheega munyas gicha aba madeadaang'u, hean ginung'waadi saawa goobiida geatinda weajoodiga nyaawa, amang'ata goombal saawa ak iidu nea gabiigu ak gooyeawuseey hean giileeysiit aba humng'eeda ak giweadi saawa nyaamoana aba baydeaydaang'u. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NEH.9.28",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NEH.9.28"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "29",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NEH 9:29"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "29",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ak gireekusi saawa aba gideaba gabiiksa saawa deaweedeadaang'u. Hean ghwanaawa nea mooleeysiiniit diigheanyeakaagu, ak goodiiy aba badayda deaweedeadaang'u, nea siida jea ghoang'waay gaygoobiida, ak goodiing'da haluuleeka nyaawa nea ghoahang'waay iheenga nyaawa nea masisiina mureeda. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NEH.9.29",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NEH.9.29"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "30",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NEH 9:30"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "30",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nea nimilikghti gweanyeeka saang'a aba badaydeaba saawa, ak ea nireekusi saawa aba gurooroadaang'u aba naweeda sibangaagu; ak ea mooleeyseey iit. Ak aba nih ginung' goobissa saawa geatinda fuga eemoojiga suurja. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NEH.9.30",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NEH.9.30"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "31",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NEH 9:31"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "31",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nea aba baydeaydaang'u haw ea mii nung'waada saawa goosha ghana nung'usiina heeda saawa; aba gideaba ang'iing'i guwoosi ASEETA mideawa dagheerjeanduumeeda ea baydeayda.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NEH.9.31",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NEH.9.31"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "31",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NEH 9:31"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "31",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NEH.9.31",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NEH.9.31"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "32",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NEH 9:32"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "32",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Asi ghamneawa, ASEETEANYA, aahaw nea gwandeawa uurda nea ASEETA siiwali, dea ang'oonyi neajeeda ea bariinyeega huumwa, gidasimwandi sean aseasa ea sugoodigaasa, ea fugaasa hees, ea ashoohoodigaasa, ea sibangaasa, ea ghweanigaasa, ea fugaagu sean, ghang'eada damanda sugoodiga ng'eanyiida Ashuru ea ghoah ghamneawa ng'asheesu adeenung' ghoah gea manang'i. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NEH.9.32",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NEH.9.32"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "33",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NEH 9:33"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "33",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ak ang'iing'i guwoosi doabiiwaat aba badaydeaba ng'asheesu sean sinyaschiin; aba gideaba ang'iing'i gisini gea huumwa, nea aseasa geesinyi gea munyas; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NEH.9.33",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NEH.9.33"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "34",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NEH 9:34"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "34",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ak sugoodigaasa, ea fugaasa hees, ea ashoohoodigaasa, ea ghweanigaasa, ea mwaang'waanya deaweedeadaang'u nea mooleeysiiniit diigheanyeakaagu ea reekusiindaang'u iidawi saawa. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NEH.9.34",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NEH.9.34"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "35",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NEH 9:35"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "35",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Aba gideaba miigagadiyeeseey aba jeeda sugoocheanduumeenyaawa aba alooheadaang'u haw iidawi saawa, ea ng'eanyiita haw bea baruureega iidawi saawa aba madeanyaawaan; ak ea miighwanung'waada sinooda gadiyoojiga nyaawa munyas. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NEH.9.35",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NEH.9.35"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "36",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NEH 9:36"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "36",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ng'ula aseasa askweareani geewooschi soomjooga aba ng'eanyiida ghayi iidawi ghweanigaasa gahoosasa nea ghwaak haghweagaaschi ea haleanjeadaanyi miyaas, ng'ula aseasa geewooschi soomjooga. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NEH.9.36",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NEH.9.36"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "37",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NEH 9:37"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "37",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ak baruureagaaschi gageanda sugoodiga iyiini badahuukaasa riing'eegaasa; ak gwandeawa uurda eara aba sasanuukaasa ea aba dugwaasa aba gidagasiida saawa, ak aseasa geendi jeeda sawanadeeda haw.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NEH.9.37",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NEH.9.37"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Buuneeda ghwayiin neajeeda giirooraneeda",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
